---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../../styles/sub-pages.css';
import '../../styles/designing-kinpaku.css';
---

<Base
  title="与 Impeccable 共设计 | Impeccable（汉化版）"
  description="核心循环：起步、迭代、打磨、维护。如何端到端使用 Impeccable——从空白文件，到上线的功能，再到还清的设计债。"
  activeNav="designing"
  canonicalPath="/designing"
  bodyClass="sub-page designing-page-body designing-kinpaku kinpaku-chrome"
>

<div class="designing-page">
  <section class="designing-hero">
    <header class="designing-page-header">
      <h1 class="designing-page-title">与 <em>Impeccable</em> 共设计</h1>
      <p class="designing-page-lede">在四个阶段中使用 Impeccable：设定上下文、改进现有的东西、上线前检查，以及防止设计系统漂移。</p>
    </header>

    <div class="designing-loop-wrap" aria-label="四阶段循环">
    <span class="designing-loop-wrap-eyebrow">核心循环</span>
    <div class="designing-loop">

      <a class="designing-loop-node designing-loop-node--start" href="#start">
        <span class="designing-loop-name">起步</span>
        <span class="designing-loop-hint">从空白文件出发，经过简报，做成有设计感的功能。</span>
      </a>
      <a class="designing-loop-node designing-loop-node--iterate" href="#iterate">
        <span class="designing-loop-name">迭代</span>
        <span class="designing-loop-hint">原位精修。命令行或浏览器皆可。</span>
      </a>
      <a class="designing-loop-node designing-loop-node--polish" href="#polish">
        <span class="designing-loop-name">打磨</span>
        <span class="designing-loop-hint">上线前关卡。audit、clarify、harden。</span>
      </a>
      <a class="designing-loop-node designing-loop-node--maintain" href="#maintain">
        <span class="designing-loop-name">维护</span>
        <span class="designing-loop-hint">趁设计债尚未固化，及早偿还。</span>
      </a>
      <div class="designing-loop-wheel" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg class="designing-loop-wheel-svg" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet">
          <circle class="designing-loop-wheel-ring" cx="50" cy="50" r="46"/>
          <!-- 12 tick marks at 30° increments. Cardinals (0/90/180/270) stronger. -->
          <line class="designing-loop-wheel-tick designing-loop-wheel-tick--cardinal" x1="50" y1="2.5" x2="50" y2="5.5"/>
          <line class="designing-loop-wheel-tick" x1="73" y1="8.7" x2="72" y2="11.4"/>
          <line class="designing-loop-wheel-tick" x1="91.3" y1="27" x2="88.6" y2="28"/>
          <line class="designing-loop-wheel-tick designing-loop-wheel-tick--cardinal" x1="97.5" y1="50" x2="94.5" y2="50"/>
          <line class="designing-loop-wheel-tick" x1="91.3" y1="73" x2="88.6" y2="72"/>
          <line class="designing-loop-wheel-tick" x1="73" y1="91.3" x2="72" y2="88.6"/>
          <line class="designing-loop-wheel-tick designing-loop-wheel-tick--cardinal" x1="50" y1="97.5" x2="50" y2="94.5"/>
          <line class="designing-loop-wheel-tick" x1="27" y1="91.3" x2="28" y2="88.6"/>
          <line class="designing-loop-wheel-tick" x1="8.7" y1="73" x2="11.4" y2="72"/>
          <line class="designing-loop-wheel-tick designing-loop-wheel-tick--cardinal" x1="2.5" y1="50" x2="5.5" y2="50"/>
          <line class="designing-loop-wheel-tick" x1="8.7" y1="27" x2="11.4" y2="28"/>
          <line class="designing-loop-wheel-tick" x1="27" y1="8.7" x2="28" y2="11.4"/>
        </svg>
        <svg class="designing-loop-wheel-dot-svg" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet">
          <!-- Clockwise-orbiting accent dot, animates with offset-path. -->
          <circle class="designing-loop-wheel-dot" cx="0" cy="0" r="2.2"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="designing-loop-wheel-arrow designing-loop-wheel-arrow--ne">&#x2198;</span>
        <span class="designing-loop-wheel-arrow designing-loop-wheel-arrow--se">&#x2199;</span>
        <span class="designing-loop-wheel-arrow designing-loop-wheel-arrow--sw">&#x2196;</span>
        <span class="designing-loop-wheel-arrow designing-loop-wheel-arrow--nw">&#x2197;</span>
        <div class="designing-loop-wheel-center">
          <span class="designing-loop-wheel-center-label">设计中</span>
          <span class="designing-loop-wheel-center-mark">impeccable</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="designing-loop-track">
  <nav class="designing-phasenav" aria-label="循环阶段">
    <a class="designing-phasenav-link" href="#start">起步</a>
    <a class="designing-phasenav-link" href="#iterate">迭代</a>
    <a class="designing-phasenav-link" href="#polish">打磨</a>
    <a class="designing-phasenav-link" href="#maintain">维护</a>
  </nav>

  <section class="ks-section designing-phase" id="start">
    <header class="ks-section-head designing-phase-head">
      <h2 class="designing-phase-title">从上下文开始。</h2>
      <p class="ks-section-sub designing-phase-sub">在让智能体动手设计之前，先给它基本信息：界面为谁而做、应该是什么感觉、应该避开什么，以及这是营销页面还是应用界面。<code>/impeccable init</code> 会先把这份上下文保存下来。之后可用 <code>/impeccable shape</code> 产出简报，或用 <code>/impeccable new-work</code> 完成完整构建。</p>
      <div class="designing-phase-commands">
        <a class="designing-phase-cmd" href="/docs-cn/impeccable/docs/init">/impeccable init</a>
        <a class="designing-phase-cmd" href="/docs-cn/impeccable/docs/shape">/impeccable shape</a>
        <a class="designing-phase-cmd" href="/docs-cn/impeccable/docs/new-work">/impeccable new-work</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="designing-phase-body designing-start">
      <div class="designing-start-step">
        <div class="designing-start-grid">
          <div class="docs-viz-file" style="margin:0">
            <div class="docs-viz-file-header">
              <span class="docs-viz-file-name">PRODUCT.md</span>
              <span class="docs-viz-file-status">由 init 写入</span>
            </div>
            <div class="docs-viz-file-body">
              <div class="docs-viz-file-row">
                <span class="docs-viz-file-k">调性</span>
                <span class="docs-viz-file-v">产品。设计服务于任务。</span>
              </div>
              <div class="docs-viz-file-row">
                <span class="docs-viz-file-k">用户</span>
                <span class="docs-viz-file-v">值班的 SRE，快速阅读，常常在黑暗环境中。</span>
              </div>
              <div class="docs-viz-file-row">
                <span class="docs-viz-file-k">语调</span>
                <span class="docs-viz-file-v">冷静、克制，毫不浮夸。</span>
              </div>
              <div class="docs-viz-file-row">
                <span class="docs-viz-file-k">反向参考</span>
                <span class="docs-viz-file-v">紫色渐变。玻璃拟态。浮夸营销腔。</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="designing-start-grid-prose">
            <p>init 会进行一次简短的设置访谈，涉及受众、品牌/产品路线、语调和反向参考。它写入 <code>PRODUCT.md</code>，若有代码可扫描，还会提供一份 <code>DESIGN.md</code>。此后每条命令在生成之前都会先读这两个文件。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="designing-start-step">
        <p class="designing-start-step-note">从零开始的工作，一份视觉参考比一段长提示词更有用。<code>shape</code> 可以起草一份品牌工具包供你评审，<code>new-work</code> 则可以照着高保真视觉稿写代码，而不是对着一段文字猜。Neo Mirai 就是完整的一圈：生成方向、实现页面、浏览器迭代。</p>

        <div class="designing-visualize-spread">
          <figure class="designing-visualize-plate designing-visualize-plate--brand">
            <a class="designing-visualize-plate-frame" href="/docs-cn/impeccable/cases/neo-mirai" aria-label="阅读 Neo Mirai 案例研究">
              <img src="/docs-cn/impeccable/assets/openai_image_2_brand.jpg" alt="自动生成的品牌工具包图版：虚构 AI 设计会议的标识组合、配色、字体样例、图标系统与应用视觉稿，呈现为温暖的大地色调。" loading="lazy" width="1536" height="1024" />
            </a>
            <figcaption class="designing-visualize-plate-cap">
              <span class="designing-visualize-plate-kind">品牌决策</span>
              <p class="designing-visualize-plate-note">品牌工具包：标识、配色、字体、图标语言、应用示例、社交图块、UI 方向，一张图版尽收眼底、便于评审。通过评审的决策会写入 <code>DESIGN.md</code>。</p>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>

          <figure class="designing-visualize-plate designing-visualize-plate--hifi">
            <a class="designing-visualize-plate-frame" href="/docs-cn/impeccable/cases/neo-mirai" aria-label="阅读 Neo Mirai 案例研究">
              <img src="/docs-cn/impeccable/assets/openai_image_2_hifi.jpg" alt="自动生成的高保真落地页视觉稿：为虚构的东京 AI 设计会议排出的长幅编辑式构图，温暖的大地色调配上有态度的衬线展示字体。" loading="lazy" width="864" height="1821" />
            </a>
            <figcaption class="designing-visualize-plate-cap">
              <span class="designing-visualize-plate-kind">页面视觉稿</span>
              <p class="designing-visualize-plate-note">高保真参考。在写第一行 CSS 之前就看清终点。让代码朝一张具体的图像靠拢，而不是对着一篇抽象简报猜。这就是质变所在。</p>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>

          <figure class="designing-visualize-plate designing-visualize-plate--live">
            <a class="designing-visualize-plate-frame" href="/docs-cn/impeccable/neo-mirai/" aria-label="打开 Neo Mirai 可运行站点">
              <img src="/docs-cn/impeccable/assets/cases/neo-mirai/live-page.png" alt="已实现的 Neo Mirai 网站全页截图。" loading="lazy" width="1440" height="3013" />
            </a>
            <figcaption class="designing-visualize-plate-cap">
              <span class="designing-visualize-plate-kind">可运行站点</span>
              <p class="designing-visualize-plate-note">上线的构建。视觉稿变成了语义化标记、重新生成的素材、响应式修复、导航状态、讲者轮播行为，以及经浏览器验证的打磨。<a href="/docs-cn/impeccable/neo-mirai/">打开可运行站点</a>。</p>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>

        <p class="designing-visualize-foot">前两张图版由 <strong>OpenAI GPT Image 2</strong> 生成，第三张是实现后的 Neo Mirai 页面。<strong>Gemini Nano Banana Pro</strong>、<strong>Imagen 4 Ultra</strong> 与 <strong>Grok Imagen</strong> 也可以这样用，经由 Codex、Gemini CLI 及兼容的 AI 宿主（harness）。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ks-section designing-phase" id="iterate">
    <header class="ks-section-head designing-phase-head">
      <h2 class="designing-phase-title">改进已有的东西。</h2>
      <p class="ks-section-sub designing-phase-sub">只要界面上有了东西，你就是在迭代。有两条路径：用特定命令处理叫得出名字的维度，或用 Live Mode 做视觉探索。</p>
    </header>

    <div class="designing-phase-body">
      <div class="designing-iterate-split">
        <div class="designing-iterate-col">
          <h3 class="designing-iterate-name">当改动说得清名字。</h3>
          <p class="designing-iterate-when">输入一条命令，让技能执行一门具体的设计学科。适合你说得出那个词的时候：字体排印、布局、颜色、动效。</p>
          <div class="designing-iterate-terminal" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="designing-iterate-terminal-line"><span class="designing-iterate-terminal-prompt">$</span><span>/impeccable polish pricing</span></div>
            <div class="designing-iterate-terminal-line"><span class="designing-iterate-terminal-prompt">$</span><span>/impeccable bolder hero</span></div>
            <div class="designing-iterate-terminal-line"><span class="designing-iterate-terminal-prompt">$</span><span>/impeccable typeset checkout</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="designing-iterate-col">
          <h3 class="designing-iterate-name">当改动指出来更容易。</h3>
          <p class="designing-iterate-when">在你的 AI 工具里运行 <code>/impeccable live</code>，它会把这套选取器挂到你正在运行的开发服务器上。指向任意元素，画一笔或输入你想要的效果，然后按下 Go。得到三个生产质量的变体；采纳其一，它就会写回源码。</p>
          <div class="designing-iterate-live" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="docs-viz-live-frame" style="max-width:100%">
              <div class="docs-viz-live-chrome">
                <span class="docs-viz-live-dot"></span>
                <span class="docs-viz-live-dot"></span>
                <span class="docs-viz-live-dot"></span>
                <span class="docs-viz-live-url">localhost:3000</span>
              </div>
              <div class="docs-viz-live-stage">
                <div class="docs-viz-live-target">
                  <span class="docs-viz-live-kicker">第 04 期</span>
                  <h4 class="docs-viz-live-title">一封信，<em>偶尔</em>寄出。</h4>
                  <button class="docs-viz-live-btn" type="button">给我也寄一封</button>
                </div>
                <div class="docs-viz-live-outline"></div>
                <div class="docs-viz-live-ctx">
                  <button class="docs-viz-live-ctx-nav" type="button">&#x2039;</button>
                  <span class="docs-viz-live-ctx-counter">2 / 3</span>
                  <button class="docs-viz-live-ctx-nav" type="button">&#x203A;</button>
                  <span class="docs-viz-live-ctx-divider"></span>
                  <button class="docs-viz-live-ctx-discard" type="button">&#x2715;</button>
                  <button class="docs-viz-live-ctx-accept" type="button">采纳</button>
                </div>
                <div class="docs-viz-live-gbar">
                  <span class="docs-viz-live-gbar-mark">
                    <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M5 2.5 L13.5 2.5 L5.5 21.5 L5 21.5 Q2.5 21.5 2.5 19 L2.5 5 Q2.5 2.5 5 2.5 Z"/><path d="M16.5 2.5 L19 2.5 Q21.5 2.5 21.5 5 L21.5 19 Q21.5 21.5 19 21.5 L8.5 21.5 Z"/></svg>
                  </span>
                  <span class="docs-viz-live-gbar-btn is-active">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><line x1="22" y1="12" x2="18" y2="12"/><line x1="6" y1="12" x2="2" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="6" x2="12" y2="2"/><line x1="12" y1="22" x2="12" y2="18"/></svg>
                    <span>选取</span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="docs-viz-live-gbar-btn">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg>
                    <span>插入</span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="docs-viz-live-gbar-btn">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
                    <span>检测</span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="docs-viz-live-gbar-btn">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><rect x="3" y="3" width="8" height="8" rx="1"/><rect x="13" y="3" width="8" height="8" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="13" width="8" height="8" rx="1"/><rect x="13" y="13" width="8" height="8" rx="1" opacity="0.5"/></svg>
                    <span class="docs-viz-live-gbar-btn-mono">DESIGN.md</span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="docs-viz-live-gbar-divider"></span>
                  <span class="docs-viz-live-gbar-x">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="3" y1="3" x2="11" y2="11"/><line x1="11" y1="3" x2="3" y2="11"/></svg>
                  </span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <table class="designing-iterate-table">
        <caption>什么时候用哪个</caption>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">修一种说不出名字的"不对劲"</th>
            <td><a href="/docs-cn/impeccable/live-mode">/impeccable live</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">应用一门具体的设计学科：字体、布局、颜色、动效</th>
            <td><a href="/docs-cn/impeccable/docs/typeset">/typeset</a> &middot; <a href="/docs-cn/impeccable/docs/layout">/layout</a> &middot; <a href="/docs-cn/impeccable/docs/colorize">/colorize</a> &middot; <a href="/docs-cn/impeccable/docs/animate">/animate</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">并排探索三个方向</th>
            <td><a href="/docs-cn/impeccable/live-mode">/impeccable live</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">问一句"这做得好吗？"</th>
            <td><a href="/docs-cn/impeccable/docs/critique">/impeccable critique</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">让保守的设计活起来，或给吵闹的设计降降调</th>
            <td><a href="/docs-cn/impeccable/docs/bolder">/bolder</a> &middot; <a href="/docs-cn/impeccable/docs/quieter">/quieter</a></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ks-section designing-phase" id="polish">
    <header class="ks-section-head designing-phase-head">
      <h2 class="designing-phase-title">上线前关卡。</h2>
      <p class="ks-section-sub designing-phase-sub">任何东西上线之前，先过这三条命令。它们不做重新设计，而是找出还没修完的问题。把目标收窄：细看一个区块，胜过扫一眼整个页面——就像镜头越收越清晰。</p>
    </header>

    <div class="designing-phase-body">
      <div class="designing-polish">
        <div class="designing-polish-band">
          <span class="designing-polish-band-label">上线前</span>
          <div class="designing-polish-band-cmds">
            <a href="/docs-cn/impeccable/docs/audit">audit</a>
            <a href="/docs-cn/impeccable/docs/clarify">clarify</a>
            <a href="/docs-cn/impeccable/docs/harden">harden</a>
          </div>
          <span class="designing-polish-band-meta">03 &middot; 04</span>
        </div>
        <div class="designing-polish-grid">
          <div class="designing-polish-col">
            <h3 class="designing-polish-name">打个分。</h3>
            <p class="designing-polish-desc">五个维度按 0 到 4 打分：无障碍、性能、主题适配、响应式、反模式。发现按 P0 到 P3 标注。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="designing-polish-col">
            <h3 class="designing-polish-name">重写文案。</h3>
            <p class="designing-polish-desc">标签、错误信息、空状态文案、微文案，并按 PRODUCT.md 里的受众调整语气。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="designing-polish-col">
            <h3 class="designing-polish-name">用真实世界做压力测试。</h3>
            <p class="designing-polish-desc">60 个字符的名字、德语的商品标题、数十亿的价格、500 错误、离线状态。生产环境的数据就是这么乱。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ks-section designing-phase" id="maintain">
    <header class="ks-section-head designing-phase-head">
      <h2 class="designing-phase-title">设计债真实存在。把它还上。</h2>
      <p class="ks-section-sub designing-phase-sub">功能不断上线，漂移随之发生。两条命令能在差异固化之前把它弥合。</p>
    </header>

    <div class="designing-phase-body">
      <div class="ks-bento designing-maintain">
        <article class="ks-bento-tile ks-bento-tile--span-6">
          <span class="designing-maintain-label"><a href="/docs-cn/impeccable/docs/extract">/impeccable extract</a></span>
          <div class="designing-maintain-stage">
            <div class="designing-extract-viz" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="designing-extract-before">
                <span class="designing-extract-btn">订阅</span>
                <span class="designing-extract-btn">提交</span>
                <span class="designing-extract-btn">加入</span>
                <span class="designing-extract-btn">发送</span>
                <span class="designing-extract-btn">前往</span>
